  "mechanism": "Child exit and POSIX timer expiry both enqueue a KernelSignal, whose to_info returns siginfo_t::new(num, SI_KERNEL) with zeroed fields, so SIGCHLD loses CLD_EXITED, si_pid and si_status and a timer signal loses SI_TIMER and sigev_value.",
